From: Hao Lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 21:47:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [llvm-profgen] Document IP mode and finalize options and
 reports

Use enumerated IP options without introducing an aggregation default. Preserve parser diagnostics once and report parse failures. Clarify boundary errors without changing instruction goldens, distinguish unknown values from confirmed absence, and keep overflowing LOST ratios unknown. Document the IP workflow and complete version-1 report schema, with regression coverage for the clarified contracts.
